1
00:01:33,460 --> 00:01:35,880
Mission: Clear up everyone's

2
00:01:35,880 --> 00:01:38,130
misunderstanding about Sensei!

3
00:01:38,130 --> 00:01:40,840
Starting with the bus journey.

4
00:01:41,210 --> 00:01:43,300
The "Sit With Sensei" strategy!

5
00:01:43,300 --> 00:01:45,340
Sensei will sit in the
seat closest to the front, 

6
00:01:45,340 --> 00:01:48,210
then a student will sit next to her!

7
00:01:48,550 --> 00:01:49,760
It'll just be them and Sensei at first, 

8
00:01:49,760 --> 00:01:53,550
but I'll somehow sit
nearby to act as a go-between!

9
00:01:53,550 --> 00:01:58,510
I'm not great at that kinda thing, 
but I have to do it, for Sensei!

10
00:01:58,920 --> 00:02:01,630
Okay, next up is Class 2, 
time to get on the bus.

11
00:02:01,630 --> 00:02:04,170
Sit in order of your class number, 
from front to back.

12
00:02:04,420 --> 00:02:08,550
Huh?! This wasn't part of the plan!

13
00:02:09,550 --> 00:02:13,380
Abikura-kun, make sure you enjoy
this school camping trip too, okay?

14
00:02:13,710 --> 00:02:14,800
Right...

15
00:02:14,960 --> 00:02:17,090
I'm kinda happy, but...

16
00:02:18,590 --> 00:02:21,210
Okay, let's regroup and
try the next strategy!

17
00:02:21,630 --> 00:02:23,710
The "Soothe Sickness
with Sensei" strategy!

18
00:02:24,260 --> 00:02:26,630
If Sensei tends to
someone who feels unwell, 

19
00:02:26,630 --> 00:02:30,630
they'll surely see that she's not scary!

20
00:02:30,880 --> 00:02:35,050
Good job everyone on making
it through that long bus journey.

21
00:02:35,050 --> 00:02:37,960
If anyone's feeling unwell...

22
00:02:39,210 --> 00:02:40,260
Sensei?!

23
00:02:41,130 --> 00:02:42,550
S-sorry.

24
00:02:42,550 --> 00:02:44,920
When I got off the bus, 
I was hit with a wave of nausea.

25
00:02:44,920 --> 00:02:46,960
Sensei's nauseous?!

26
00:02:46,960 --> 00:02:49,210
Huh? That voice was scary!!

27
00:02:49,420 --> 00:02:52,630
Typical Weak and Wimpy Sensei, 
she can't even handle a bus journey.

28
00:02:53,340 --> 00:02:55,710
As the class president, 
I'll show everyone to the

29
00:02:55,710 --> 00:02:57,090
hotel in Sensei's place!

30
00:02:58,550 --> 00:03:00,960
The next activity is hiking!

31
00:03:01,340 --> 00:03:04,260
Encouraging each other as
we try to reach the top.

32
00:03:04,260 --> 00:03:07,420
It's the perfect activity for
strengthening everyone's relationships...

33
00:03:08,260 --> 00:03:11,380
but nobody's even coming near Sensei!!

34
00:03:12,460 --> 00:03:15,840
She seems to be more on
edge than usual, too.

35
00:03:16,760 --> 00:03:19,130
The mountains can be dangerous, 

36
00:03:19,130 --> 00:03:22,670
so if anything feels strange, 
please let me know!

37
00:03:22,670 --> 00:03:25,460
Ah, so her sense of duty is
behind that intimidating aura.

38
00:03:26,090 --> 00:03:27,590
Hey, wait up.

39
00:03:28,760 --> 00:03:31,460
It's dangerous to go too
far ahead of Sensei!

40
00:03:31,460 --> 00:03:33,340
You should only walk as far
as our voices will carry.

41
00:03:33,340 --> 00:03:35,760
Huh? W-well, you're not wrong.

42
00:03:36,010 --> 00:03:38,550
B-but there's a teacher up ahead, too!

43
00:03:38,550 --> 00:03:40,670
W-we'll have them supervise us!

44
00:03:41,380 --> 00:03:44,670
Dammit! How can I get people
to be around Sensei...

45
00:03:45,170 --> 00:03:46,920
Huh? Sensei?

46
00:03:51,090 --> 00:03:53,050
Sh-she's completely exhausted!

47
00:03:53,300 --> 00:03:58,130
There was no way she was gonna be able
to make it all the way up the mountain.

48
00:03:58,300 --> 00:04:01,050
This plan was doomed from the start!

49
00:04:01,300 --> 00:04:03,050
Ah, there you are!

50
00:04:03,050 --> 00:04:05,510
Are you okay, Hiwamura-sensei?

51
00:04:06,590 --> 00:04:08,800
Oh, good, Abikura's with you.

52
00:04:08,800 --> 00:04:10,960
Since you have no stamina, 

53
00:04:10,960 --> 00:04:14,260
I planned for us to take
a break around here.

54
00:04:14,550 --> 00:04:17,300
So I'll take it from here, Sensei!

55
00:04:17,300 --> 00:04:19,800
S-sorry!

56
00:04:19,800 --> 00:04:22,089
She lucked out in the coworker department.

57
00:04:23,170 --> 00:04:26,880
I'm sorry, Abikura-kun.
I've slowed you down, too.

58
00:04:27,260 --> 00:04:28,380
I'll be okay on my own, 

59
00:04:28,380 --> 00:04:33,380
so please go ahead and
join up with the others...

60
00:04:33,380 --> 00:04:36,010
I can't just leave her
when she's struggling!

61
00:04:36,380 --> 00:04:39,880
It's okay. I'm tired too, 
so I'm gonna rest.

62
00:04:47,920 --> 00:04:51,090
It's so hot already.

63
00:04:51,090 --> 00:04:52,380
It sure is.

64
00:04:52,380 --> 00:04:54,840
She's wearing some kind
of sports bra today.

65
00:04:56,960 --> 00:04:59,260
A-Abikura-kun.

66
00:04:59,590 --> 00:05:01,760
I'm just going to...
go over there for a moment.

67
00:05:01,760 --> 00:05:03,880
Could you wait here?

68
00:05:03,880 --> 00:05:05,590
Huh? Where're you going?

69
00:05:05,800 --> 00:05:09,710
You probably shouldn't
go too far, you know?

70
00:05:09,710 --> 00:05:12,590
Y-you're right, but...

71
00:05:12,590 --> 00:05:16,090
I need to... go to the bathroom.

72
00:05:17,590 --> 00:05:19,420
What?!

73
00:05:19,590 --> 00:05:23,920
B-but we're still pretty
far from the lodge.

74
00:05:23,920 --> 00:05:29,050
I know, that's why...
I brought a portable toilet.

75
00:05:29,460 --> 00:05:31,760
So I'll just go and...
use it under that tree.

76
00:05:32,050 --> 00:05:35,590
Typical Weak and Wimpy Sensei, 
she even has a weak bladder.

77
00:05:35,760 --> 00:05:37,510
So, um...

78
00:05:38,050 --> 00:05:41,010
Could you... watch?

79
00:05:41,010 --> 00:05:42,210
Watch what?!

80
00:05:42,420 --> 00:05:45,050
Watch to make sure nobody comes...

81
00:05:45,050 --> 00:05:47,510
Oh, right! Of course!

82
00:05:47,840 --> 00:05:50,090
S-sorry.

83
00:05:50,090 --> 00:05:52,630
H-how did things end up like this?

84
00:05:52,630 --> 00:05:56,090
Wait, this is far worse for
her than it is for me.

85
00:05:56,340 --> 00:05:59,670
I just have to guard her to the best of my
ability and make sure nobody interrupts!

86
00:06:01,130 --> 00:06:03,840
I feel like I can hear a small stream.

87
00:06:04,800 --> 00:06:07,380
My hiking strategy ended in failure.

88
00:06:10,550 --> 00:06:13,380
The first day didn't go well at all.

89
00:06:13,920 --> 00:06:18,170
And I was so busy with class president
duties that I missed the bathing time.

90
00:06:18,550 --> 00:06:19,960
It's lucky the baths are still open.

91
00:06:21,050 --> 00:06:23,630
The school camping trip is for
two nights and three days.

92
00:06:23,880 --> 00:06:27,460
But the third day is when we travel back, 
so tomorrow's basically our only chance.

93
00:06:28,210 --> 00:06:31,420
How can I get Sensei to
become friends with everyone?

94
00:06:31,630 --> 00:06:34,010
Yay! We've got the bath to ourselves!

95
00:06:34,010 --> 00:06:37,460
The boys' bathing time and the girls'
bathing time have both finished now

96
00:06:37,460 --> 00:06:39,010
so there shouldn't be anyone else here.

97
00:06:41,340 --> 00:06:44,210
And it's all thanks to Yukki! Super lucky!

98
00:06:44,510 --> 00:06:46,460
I thought it might be a little tough for

99
00:06:46,460 --> 00:06:48,630
you to bathe with all of the other girls, 

100
00:06:48,630 --> 00:06:50,590
so I arranged for us to just bathe

101
00:06:50,590 --> 00:06:52,510
as a smaller group with people you know.

102
00:06:52,510 --> 00:06:54,130
Yeah. Thanks.

103
00:06:58,090 --> 00:07:00,590
This isn't just bad, 
it's a total nightmare!

104
00:07:00,800 --> 00:07:03,260
I love big baths like this!

105
00:07:03,260 --> 00:07:04,630
H-hey, Mizu!

106
00:07:04,630 --> 00:07:05,960
You're being too loud!

107
00:07:09,260 --> 00:07:10,960
I'll go and get it.

108
00:07:10,960 --> 00:07:12,760
Sorry, Hiwamura.

109
00:07:18,880 --> 00:07:19,420
Huh?

110
00:07:23,510 --> 00:07:25,340
I got found out right away!

111
00:07:25,630 --> 00:07:26,920
What're you doing here?!

112
00:07:26,920 --> 00:07:29,590
W-well, one thing led to the other and...

113
00:07:29,590 --> 00:07:31,170
I was late for bath time.

114
00:07:31,170 --> 00:07:33,670
This is where the boys' bath is, right?

115
00:07:34,170 --> 00:07:38,460
I mean, yeah, 
it was until the staff cleaned it out...

116
00:07:38,460 --> 00:07:43,260
I checked it was empty and then I went
and told the others they could come in.

117
00:07:43,260 --> 00:07:46,420
I guess I must've come
in here during that time.

118
00:07:46,960 --> 00:07:48,050
I'm sorry!

119
00:07:48,050 --> 00:07:50,460
I didn't check thoroughly enough.

120
00:07:50,460 --> 00:07:52,210
No, it's definitely my fault for coming in

121
00:07:52,210 --> 00:07:54,090
after the designated bathing time.

122
00:07:54,170 --> 00:07:56,800
Huh? Is everything okay, Hiyorin?

123
00:07:56,800 --> 00:07:59,800
Wha?! E-e-everything's fine!

124
00:08:00,760 --> 00:08:03,380
I-I'll figure out a way for you

125
00:08:03,380 --> 00:08:05,920
to sneak out as soon as I can.

126
00:08:06,170 --> 00:08:07,880
S-sorry.

127
00:08:09,210 --> 00:08:11,710
The starry sky's so pretty from here!

128
00:08:11,880 --> 00:08:13,670
I heard there's a legend at our school
saying that if a guy and a girl

129
00:08:13,670 --> 00:08:15,380
confess their feelings to
each other under the stars

130
00:08:15,380 --> 00:08:19,800
on the school camping trip, 
they'll be together forever!

131
00:08:19,800 --> 00:08:21,300
Totes emosh!

132
00:08:21,300 --> 00:08:23,010
Really? That's cool.

133
00:08:23,130 --> 00:08:24,260
So is there a guy you'd

134
00:08:24,260 --> 00:08:25,510
want to be with, Mizu?

135
00:08:25,760 --> 00:08:26,460
Wha?!

136
00:08:27,090 --> 00:08:28,550
Wh-why're you asking me?!

137
00:08:28,550 --> 00:08:30,550
Ah, I wanna know, too!

138
00:08:30,550 --> 00:08:33,710
You're nice to all the guys, 
so it's impossible

139
00:08:33,710 --> 00:08:36,590
to tell whether you like any of ‘em, Mizu.

140
00:08:37,090 --> 00:08:40,210
I-I don't really have anyone I like...

141
00:08:40,549 --> 00:08:41,840
I don't!

142
00:08:41,840 --> 00:08:44,460
Hey, Mizu! You're crushing Yukki!

143
00:08:44,590 --> 00:08:46,260
I-I can't hear very clearly, 

144
00:08:46,260 --> 00:08:48,170
but it sounds like they're pretty
absorbed in their conversation.

145
00:08:48,170 --> 00:08:49,420
This might be my chance...

146
00:08:49,420 --> 00:08:51,510
Let's ask Hiyorin, too!

147
00:08:51,670 --> 00:08:53,710
She probably knows
about real relationships!

148
00:08:55,010 --> 00:08:59,380
No better time to get to know each other
then when we're sharing a bath, right?

149
00:08:59,380 --> 00:09:01,130
Uh... b-but...

150
00:09:01,510 --> 00:09:05,340
I-I see, Mukubayashi's trying
to help Sensei out, too.

151
00:09:05,340 --> 00:09:08,630
S-so Sensei... if you don't mind...

152
00:09:13,420 --> 00:09:15,920
She is scary, after all!

153
00:09:17,260 --> 00:09:19,840
She scared them because she was
so busy trying to protect me!

154
00:09:19,840 --> 00:09:22,590
Ah, wait... Both of you...

155
00:09:23,210 --> 00:09:24,050
Look out!

156
00:09:34,670 --> 00:09:37,710
A-A-A-Abikura... you jerk!

157
00:09:37,800 --> 00:09:41,590
W-were the two of you... doing it?!

158
00:09:44,760 --> 00:09:46,880
I brought everyone's journals.

159
00:09:48,300 --> 00:09:51,170
Ah! Thanks for your hard work, 
Abikura-kun.

160
00:09:51,550 --> 00:09:55,630
S-Sensei, I'm really sorry about earlier.

161
00:09:55,630 --> 00:09:57,340
Everything got messed up because of me.

162
00:09:57,340 --> 00:10:00,380
D-don't say that! I was at fault, too.

163
00:10:00,510 --> 00:10:04,090
So... what is that, exactly?

164
00:10:04,090 --> 00:10:06,800
Oh, this?

165
00:10:07,050 --> 00:10:09,010
I prepared all of these little props
to put in the woods

166
00:10:09,010 --> 00:10:10,670
for tomorrow's test of courage!

167
00:10:10,960 --> 00:10:12,420
I got them at a store, 

168
00:10:12,420 --> 00:10:14,760
then spiced them up
and remade a few parts..

169
00:10:14,760 --> 00:10:18,010
I've spent ages getting
everything ready for tomorrow!

170
00:10:18,010 --> 00:10:19,460
A-ages?!

171
00:10:20,920 --> 00:10:23,340
Don't tell the others, okay?

172
00:10:23,510 --> 00:10:25,920
Those are some serious props!

173
00:10:24,340 --> 00:10:25,920
I was so happy with all the compliments

174
00:10:25,920 --> 00:10:28,880
I got from other teachers and students

175
00:10:25,920 --> 00:10:27,590
Sensei always goes all out

176
00:10:27,590 --> 00:10:28,880
for her students.

177
00:10:28,880 --> 00:10:31,550
when I wrote that ghost costume before.

178
00:10:31,800 --> 00:10:38,300
So I thought this might be my big chance
to contribute something to the trip.

179
00:10:38,510 --> 00:10:41,670
But won't this just make
everyone even more scared of you?

180
00:10:41,920 --> 00:10:44,710
I thought you wanted
everyone to be able

181
00:10:44,710 --> 00:10:47,880
to become friends with
you during this trip...

182
00:10:48,090 --> 00:10:49,210
Yeah.

183
00:10:49,210 --> 00:10:52,550
I thought it'd be nice
if I could close the distance

184
00:10:52,550 --> 00:10:54,550
between us at least a little...

185
00:10:54,840 --> 00:10:56,340
But right now, 

186
00:10:56,340 --> 00:10:59,340
the most important thing to
me as a teacher is making sure

187
00:10:59,340 --> 00:11:05,710
that everyone has as much fun as
they can on this school camping trip!

188
00:11:06,050 --> 00:11:07,630
So Abikura-kun, 

189
00:11:07,630 --> 00:11:11,050
please don't worry about me, 
just do what you want to do.

190
00:11:11,050 --> 00:11:12,170
Sensei...

191
00:11:14,590 --> 00:11:17,550
Excuse me! I forgot a li'l something!

192
00:11:18,210 --> 00:11:19,090
Oh?

193
00:11:19,630 --> 00:11:22,130
Hiwamura-sensei's not here.

194
00:11:22,260 --> 00:11:27,050
We just hid on impulse thinking it would
be bad to be seen together...

195
00:11:27,050 --> 00:11:31,090
I wanted Hiwamura-sensei
to join in the fun!

196
00:11:31,170 --> 00:11:33,050
Sh-she's so close...

197
00:11:33,050 --> 00:11:35,340
She has that nice freshly-bathed smell.

198
00:11:35,340 --> 00:11:37,340
A-Abikura-kun...

199
00:11:38,590 --> 00:11:42,260
This feels like practice for
playing the scaring role!

200
00:11:42,260 --> 00:11:45,130
She's way too excited about
the test of courage!

201
00:11:45,300 --> 00:11:48,800
Only one and a half days
remaining of the camping trip.

202
00:12:01,800 --> 00:12:03,630
Sensei said that the most
important thing to her

203
00:12:03,630 --> 00:12:09,260
is that we all have fun on this trip, 
but I can't help worrying about her.

204
00:12:13,050 --> 00:12:14,920
Sensei's supervising, huh?

205
00:12:15,590 --> 00:12:18,630
We'll be using fire and
knives while cooking, 

206
00:12:18,630 --> 00:12:22,050
so please be careful, Abikura-kun.

207
00:12:22,050 --> 00:12:24,010
She's got that intimidating aura again.

208
00:12:24,460 --> 00:12:29,300
My plan was to get her on good terms
with everyone by cooking together, but...

209
00:12:29,300 --> 00:12:32,800
there's no way
I can invite her to join in now.

210
00:12:33,420 --> 00:12:34,880
Argh!

211
00:12:35,090 --> 00:12:37,800
I don't think I can cook, after all!

212
00:12:37,960 --> 00:12:40,340
Nothing ever goes right for some reason.

213
00:12:40,340 --> 00:12:43,210
Hey, who gave Mizu a knife?!

214
00:12:43,210 --> 00:12:44,920
What's she up to?

215
00:12:45,170 --> 00:12:46,800
Hiwamura.

216
00:12:46,800 --> 00:12:49,960
At this rate, our group won't
get to eat any curry.

217
00:12:49,960 --> 00:12:51,550
Come and help us.

218
00:12:52,420 --> 00:12:55,090
But the point of this activity

219
00:12:55,090 --> 00:12:58,460
is for students to build teamwork
skills and become independent.

220
00:12:58,460 --> 00:13:00,880
The teachers are only
supposed to supervise.

221
00:13:00,880 --> 00:13:02,210
Hiwamura...

222
00:13:02,960 --> 00:13:04,420
Please?

223
00:13:06,630 --> 00:13:09,130
I'll just help a little, then.

224
00:13:09,880 --> 00:13:12,130
Good job, Mukubayashi, Yukishita!

225
00:13:12,130 --> 00:13:15,170
They naturally found a way for
her to cook with the students!

226
00:13:15,590 --> 00:13:16,380
Here!

227
00:13:17,510 --> 00:13:20,170
This is my first time
seeing her in an apron.

228
00:13:24,050 --> 00:13:27,760
Okay, I'll cut these
vegetables here, then.

229
00:13:28,210 --> 00:13:29,090
Thanks.

230
00:13:30,510 --> 00:13:33,460
Ah. I-I kinda have a
bad feeling about this.

231
00:13:36,260 --> 00:13:38,550
Oh no!

232
00:13:39,510 --> 00:13:41,260
Is she putting a curse on the food?!

233
00:13:41,260 --> 00:13:42,840
Will we die if we eat it?!

234
00:13:42,840 --> 00:13:46,090
Typical Weak and Wimpy Sensei, 
even her knife skills are lacking!

235
00:13:46,260 --> 00:13:47,010
This can't be good!

236
00:13:47,010 --> 00:13:49,090
They're going to get the
wrong idea about her again!

237
00:13:49,210 --> 00:13:54,380
M-man! Hiwamura-sensei has
such delicate arms, you see!

238
00:13:54,380 --> 00:13:55,630
Right, Mukubayashi?

239
00:13:55,630 --> 00:13:57,420
Huh? Really?

240
00:13:57,590 --> 00:13:59,590
Huh? What're you talking
about all of a sudden?

241
00:13:59,590 --> 00:14:00,420
Gross.

242
00:14:00,420 --> 00:14:02,710
Th-this idiot!

243
00:14:03,880 --> 00:14:06,960
Thanks to that idiot Mukubayashi, 
I cut my finger.

244
00:14:06,960 --> 00:14:09,460
O-oh no!

245
00:14:12,380 --> 00:14:13,420
What?!

246
00:14:15,840 --> 00:14:18,260
Uhh... Sensei?!

247
00:14:19,090 --> 00:14:20,960
S-sowwy!

248
00:14:20,960 --> 00:14:22,550
When I used to get hurt, 

249
00:14:22,550 --> 00:14:24,880
my mom always did this for me, 
so I just did it without thinking!

250
00:14:24,880 --> 00:14:27,090
Weak n' Wimpy's mom sure is old-school!

251
00:14:27,630 --> 00:14:30,210
I'm sorry, 
that was inappropriate.

252
00:14:30,210 --> 00:14:31,800
Let's go and disinfect it.

253
00:14:31,800 --> 00:14:32,960
It-it's fine.

254
00:14:34,920 --> 00:14:37,840
Was she... eating Abikura's finger?!

255
00:14:37,840 --> 00:14:41,460
Is he offering his own flesh
and blood as a sacrifice?!

256
00:14:41,880 --> 00:14:47,130
And so, everybody kept saying the curry
that night was "Abikura" flavored...

257
00:14:53,630 --> 00:14:56,840
Aw, darn.
It started raining all of a sudden.

258
00:14:57,130 --> 00:14:59,840
Huh? The test of courage
is gonna be cancelled?!

259
00:15:01,050 --> 00:15:03,510
I was looking forward to that!

260
00:15:03,510 --> 00:15:05,510
We should just use
umbrellas and do it anyway!

261
00:15:05,510 --> 00:15:08,170
And we have a study period instead...

262
00:15:08,170 --> 00:15:10,130
Why'd it have to happen
on our school camping trip?

263
00:15:10,130 --> 00:15:11,170
This is the worst!

264
00:15:13,880 --> 00:15:15,880
Um, Sensei!

265
00:15:16,800 --> 00:15:18,170
Abikura-kun.

266
00:15:18,510 --> 00:15:21,210
Is the test of courage really cancelled?

267
00:15:21,210 --> 00:15:23,340
After you worked so hard getting
everything ready...

268
00:15:23,340 --> 00:15:26,010
Yes... I'm really sorry.

269
00:15:26,260 --> 00:15:29,380
I totally jinxed it.

270
00:15:29,840 --> 00:15:33,300
Whenever I have an important event, 
it'll always rain.

271
00:15:33,300 --> 00:15:35,840
It rained the day of my
employment exam, too.

272
00:15:35,840 --> 00:15:38,090
So this is probably my fault.

273
00:15:38,960 --> 00:15:40,460
Aw, come on.

274
00:15:40,460 --> 00:15:42,760
You can't blame yourself
for the weather, Sensei!

275
00:15:42,760 --> 00:15:46,090
S-sorry. I didn't mean to lose my cool.

276
00:15:46,460 --> 00:15:49,340
Everyone has about two
hours of free time now, 

277
00:15:49,340 --> 00:15:50,960
and then we have a study period.

278
00:15:51,300 --> 00:15:53,340
Don't be late, okay?

279
00:16:07,630 --> 00:16:09,210
H-Hiwamura-sensei!

280
00:16:09,210 --> 00:16:10,630
Come with me for a moment!

281
00:16:10,630 --> 00:16:14,090
Students from class 2 have taken
over an entire floor of the facility!

282
00:16:17,340 --> 00:16:19,510
Whoa!
This is amazing!

283
00:16:19,960 --> 00:16:22,130
Come on in, everyone!

284
00:16:22,510 --> 00:16:23,710
Look!

285
00:16:23,710 --> 00:16:25,920
Wow, that looks fun!

286
00:16:25,920 --> 00:16:30,050
It's so elaborate!
I wonder who made all of these props?

287
00:16:30,260 --> 00:16:32,460
What... is all of this?

288
00:16:32,710 --> 00:16:35,130
Ah, Hiyorin! Check it out!

289
00:16:35,130 --> 00:16:37,710
We made an indoor test of courage!
Isn't it awesome?!

290
00:16:38,090 --> 00:16:39,880
We used this whole floor!

291
00:16:39,880 --> 00:16:42,420
There are monsters hidden in each room, 

292
00:16:42,420 --> 00:16:45,800
and you have to collect the talismans
and get to the goal over there!

293
00:16:45,800 --> 00:16:48,170
It's pretty scary, 
since it looks like a school at night.

294
00:16:48,380 --> 00:16:50,840
Thanks to all the props you made, Hiyorin, 

295
00:16:50,840 --> 00:16:53,300
it's super immersive
and everybody loves it!

296
00:16:53,300 --> 00:16:57,260
Abikura suddenly had this idea to
get around the bad weather.

297
00:16:57,260 --> 00:16:59,260
A-Abikura-kun came up with this?!

298
00:16:59,340 --> 00:17:01,630
There wasn't much time, 

299
00:17:01,630 --> 00:17:03,920
but he asked all of us
to help set it all up.

300
00:17:04,089 --> 00:17:07,800
At first the teacher in charge said we
couldn't do it since it wasn't scheduled, 

301
00:17:07,800 --> 00:17:13,300
but Abikura managed to convince him and we
got permission from the facility to do it!

302
00:17:15,760 --> 00:17:18,510
Everyone's... smiling.

303
00:17:18,920 --> 00:17:21,130
I-I'm so happy!

304
00:17:22,170 --> 00:17:23,589
H-Hiyorin!

305
00:17:24,339 --> 00:17:29,670
I felt so bad for everyone that we
couldn't do the test of courage...

306
00:17:29,840 --> 00:17:33,340
since it was the last activity
of the school camping trip.

307
00:17:33,800 --> 00:17:36,590
I hated seeing the
sad looks on their faces.

308
00:17:37,090 --> 00:17:39,670
Mukubayashi-san! Are you having fun?

309
00:17:39,670 --> 00:17:42,840
You bet! It's like Halloween, it's ace!

310
00:17:42,840 --> 00:17:44,380
How about you, Yukishita-san?

311
00:17:44,380 --> 00:17:45,590
It's all right.

312
00:17:46,010 --> 00:17:49,920
I'm glad to hear it! What a relief!

313
00:17:50,210 --> 00:17:52,460
I-I'm wiped out.

314
00:17:52,460 --> 00:17:55,340
Why'd I have to write some
letter of apology kinda thing?

315
00:17:55,710 --> 00:17:57,420
Oh, you're back.

316
00:17:57,800 --> 00:17:59,380
S-Sensei!

317
00:17:59,630 --> 00:18:01,050
Abikura-kun!

318
00:18:01,510 --> 00:18:04,590
I'm sorry for doing
all this without asking!

319
00:18:04,590 --> 00:18:07,210
I was just thinking of getting
you to come and check it out!

320
00:18:07,460 --> 00:18:08,300
Look!

321
00:18:09,050 --> 00:18:12,050
Please go and scare people
to your heart's content!

322
00:18:14,050 --> 00:18:17,590
That day, plenty of
students played a monster, 

323
00:18:17,590 --> 00:18:19,960
but Sensei was the scariest of them all.

324
00:18:22,760 --> 00:18:24,090
Hey, did you hear?

325
00:18:24,090 --> 00:18:26,960
Apparently Spooky Scary Sensei was the one
who made all of those props for today, 

326
00:18:26,960 --> 00:18:28,800
and prepared everything
for the test of courage.

327
00:18:28,800 --> 00:18:32,210
Whoa, seriously?
That's a perfect fit for her.

328
00:18:32,210 --> 00:18:33,550
But, you know...

329
00:18:33,550 --> 00:18:35,590
that must mean she's
not a bad teacher after all.

330
00:18:41,340 --> 00:18:43,760
Oh, it's stopped raining.

331
00:18:46,090 --> 00:18:47,210
What's happening here?

332
00:18:47,210 --> 00:18:51,050
Sensei called me out here, 
but something seems strange.

333
00:18:51,260 --> 00:18:54,210
W-was I a little too pushy?

334
00:18:54,210 --> 00:18:56,130
A-Abikura-kun.

335
00:18:56,130 --> 00:18:57,340
Thank you!

336
00:18:58,340 --> 00:19:04,170
I heard that you took the lead in
planning the indoor test of courage.

337
00:19:04,260 --> 00:19:07,800
I had completely given up, 

338
00:19:07,800 --> 00:19:11,590
so it didn't even occur to
me that we could hold it inside.

339
00:19:11,800 --> 00:19:16,800
Everyone had fun tonight
thanks to you, Abikura-kun.

340
00:19:16,800 --> 00:19:22,670
Well, I just arranged the props you made
and brought in some people to help.

341
00:19:22,670 --> 00:19:25,670
I couldn't have done anything
without your hard work.

342
00:19:25,840 --> 00:19:30,460
That's why I'm convinced that the
reason everyone had such a great time

343
00:19:30,460 --> 00:19:34,710
was because you wanted us to enjoy
this school camping trip, Sensei.

344
00:19:36,260 --> 00:19:42,670
But although I wanted Sensei to get closer
to all of the students on this trip, 

345
00:19:42,670 --> 00:19:46,920
I had to give up on that in favor of the
preparations for the test of courage.

346
00:19:47,340 --> 00:19:51,510
Since I knew that wasn't what
she really wanted, anyways.

347
00:19:51,510 --> 00:19:55,010
But... aren't you putting
undue stress on yourself?

348
00:19:55,880 --> 00:20:01,010
You only became the class president
for the first time this year.

349
00:20:01,300 --> 00:20:02,340
And before that, 

350
00:20:02,340 --> 00:20:05,920
you weren't the type of student
to be so proactive, right?

351
00:20:05,920 --> 00:20:10,300
Your previous homeroom teacher and
Mukubayashi-san said as much.

352
00:20:10,510 --> 00:20:12,010
R-right...

353
00:20:12,380 --> 00:20:14,840
It's true that, 
looking back on it, 

354
00:20:14,840 --> 00:20:17,550
this school camping trip was
anything but uncomplicated.

355
00:20:17,840 --> 00:20:20,210
Well, that's just how much...

356
00:20:20,510 --> 00:20:22,920
I like you, Sensei.

357
00:20:25,050 --> 00:20:27,710
Ah, I mean, uh... as a teacher!

358
00:20:27,710 --> 00:20:30,460
Wh-wh-what am I saying?!

359
00:20:27,710 --> 00:20:30,460
I respect you, as an educator!

360
00:20:31,630 --> 00:20:33,550
D-do you really?

361
00:20:34,960 --> 00:20:36,800
I-I can't believe it...

362
00:20:36,800 --> 00:20:41,010
even though I'm only a first year teacher, 
getting a compliment like that...

363
00:20:41,010 --> 00:20:42,380
This is so unexpected!

364
00:20:42,550 --> 00:20:44,590
Wh-what a relief.

365
00:20:44,590 --> 00:20:48,380
She doesn't seem to suspect
that I meant it romantically.

366
00:20:48,710 --> 00:20:50,920
Y-you overestimate me!

367
00:20:50,920 --> 00:20:54,170
You shouldn't respect a
greenhorn like me this much!

368
00:20:54,170 --> 00:20:58,010
Ah, but... i-it makes
me r-r-r-really happy!

369
00:20:58,010 --> 00:21:00,170
She's so thrilled!

370
00:21:00,590 --> 00:21:05,880
W-well, it's great that
everyone had so much fun!

371
00:21:06,170 --> 00:21:07,960
And no one got hurt, 

372
00:21:07,960 --> 00:21:11,760
so I'd say this school
camping trip was a big success!

373
00:21:11,760 --> 00:21:19,010
D-did you have fun, Abikura-kun?
Was it a good trip for you?

374
00:21:20,880 --> 00:21:22,800
Me? Of course.

375
00:21:23,090 --> 00:21:27,090
It was certainly eventful, 
and I did lots of new things, 

376
00:21:27,090 --> 00:21:29,760
but this is probably the most
fun I've had at a school event.

377
00:21:32,670 --> 00:21:34,260
I'm so glad.

378
00:21:35,090 --> 00:21:36,420
I also...

379
00:21:36,420 --> 00:21:38,340
like you too, Abikura-kun!

380
00:21:40,050 --> 00:21:43,420
Guess you and I have a mutual fondness for
each other as teacher and student, huh?

381
00:21:43,420 --> 00:21:46,590
S-s-s-s-she only meant it in that sense?!

382
00:21:46,710 --> 00:21:49,460
W-well, you see, Sensei....

383
00:21:52,880 --> 00:21:56,510
S-s-s-s-sorry! The ground's all muddy!

384
00:21:58,380 --> 00:22:01,340
You're the one tripping on
me for once, Abikura-kun.

385
00:22:02,880 --> 00:22:08,510
My not-at-all uncomplicated school
camping trip ended with Sensei's smile.

